<title>USA: Mazda May US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mazda May US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			May 1-31, 1997     May 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     9,886	    11,712	    -15.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   3,957	     5,113	    -22.6</p>
<p> Import Car		 9,741	    11,242	    -13.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,313	     1,258	     +4.4</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-May 31, 1997 Jan 1-May 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    34,926	    42,701	    -17.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  14,795	    18,627	    -20.0</p>
<p> Import Car		39,610	    46,641	    -14.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	     5,475	     5,886	     -6.3</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 128 for year to date vs 129 in year ago.</p>
</text>
